tip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Poisonous\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Poisonous\">Poisonous 5</a>:</b> This effect causes the edges of this weapon to drip with a vile venom, dealing 5d6 poison damage on each hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Befouling\" title=\"Befouling\">Critical Befouling 3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Befouling\" title=\"Befouling\">Critical Befouling 3</a>:</b> This deadly weapon saps the charm from your enemies, dealing 3 Charisma damage on each critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Doubleshot\" title=\"Doubleshot\"> Doubleshot 7%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Doubleshot\" title=\"Doubleshot\"> Doubleshot 7%</a>:</b> Passive: 7% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Doubleshot. (Doubleshot is a chance to score an additional hit with a ranged attack.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Keen\" title=\"Keen\">Keen</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decodi